2025-05-01 03:17:40 - Thread-1297 (execute) - INFO - [Exploration]
Below is a quick mapping of the columns that will matter for answering  
“ What is the median of the average monthly projected sales in USD for France in 2021 … ”  

Relevant columns (and why)

• countries.country_name / country_id : identify France and get its key for joins  
• customers.cust_id / country_id      : locate French customers that appear in sales rows  
• sales.cust_id                       : link sales to those French customers  
• sales.time_id                       : join with times to put every sale in a month / year  
• sales.channel_id                    : keep only rows whose channel belongs to channel_total_id = 1  
• channels.channel_id / channel_total_id : supply that filter (=1)  
• sales.promo_id                      : keep only rows whose promotion belongs to promo_total_id = 1  
• promotions.promo_id / promo_total_id    : supply that filter (=1)  
• sales.amount_sold                   : the money figure to aggregate → average monthly sales  
• times.calendar_year / calendar_month_number : needed for “2019, 2020, 2021” and for monthly roll‑ups  
• currency.country / year / month / to_us : convert the Euro (or local) amounts to USD  
• (optional) times.time_id vs calendar_month_desc : extra date details if needed  

Typical conditions that will be used later  
• countries.country_name = 'France'  
• channels.channel_total_id = 1  
• promotions.promo_total_id = 1  
• times.calendar_year IN (2019, 2020, 2021)  

-------------------------------------------------------------------
Ten exploratory SQL queries (all plain SELECT, limited to 20 rows)
-------------------------------------------------------------------

```sql
--Description: Look‑up France and get its country_id
SELECT DISTINCT "country_id", "country_name"
FROM "countries"
WHERE "country_name" = 'France';
```

```sql
--Description: Show 20 customer ids whose country is France
SELECT DISTINCT "cust_id", "country_id"
FROM "customers"
WHERE "country_id" = (
      SELECT "country_id" FROM "countries"
      WHERE "country_name" = 'France'
)
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
--Description: List every sales channel that rolls up into channel_total_id = 1
SELECT DISTINCT "channel_id", "channel_desc"
FROM "channels"
WHERE "channel_total_id" = 1;
```

```sql
--Description: List a few promotions that roll up into promo_total_id = 1
SELECT DISTINCT "promo_id", "promo_name"
FROM "promotions"
WHERE "promo_total_id" = 1
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
--Description: Sample 2019 sales rows for French customers, filtered by channel & promo totals
SELECT DISTINCT "cust_id", "prod_id", "time_id", "amount_sold"
FROM "sales"
WHERE "cust_id" IN (
        SELECT "cust_id" FROM "customers"
        WHERE "country_id" = (
              SELECT "country_id" FROM "countries"
              WHERE "country_name" = 'France'
        )
)
AND "channel_id" IN (
        SELECT "channel_id" FROM "channels"
        WHERE "channel_total_id" = 1
)
AND "promo_id"  IN (
        SELECT "promo_id" FROM "promotions"
        WHERE "promo_total_id" = 1
)
AND "time_id" BETWEEN '2019-01-01' AND '2019-12-31'
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
--Description: Same as above but for calendar year 2020
SELECT DISTINCT "cust_id", "prod_id", "time_id", "amount_sold"
FROM "sales"
WHERE "cust_id" IN (
        SELECT "cust_id" FROM "customers"
        WHERE "country_id" = (
              SELECT "country_id" FROM "countries"
              WHERE "country_name" = 'France'
        )
)
AND "channel_id" IN (
        SELECT "channel_id" FROM "channels"
        WHERE "channel_total_id" = 1
)
AND "promo_id"  IN (
        SELECT "promo_id" FROM "promotions"
        WHERE "promo_total_id" = 1
)
AND "time_id" BETWEEN '2020-01-01' AND '2020-12-31'
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
--Description: Inspect the times table for a few 2019 dates to verify month/year columns
SELECT DISTINCT "time_id",
       "calendar_month_number",
       "calendar_year"
FROM "times"
WHERE "calendar_year" = 2019
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
--Description: Aggregate (sum) monthly sales amounts in 2019 for France after all filters
SELECT t."calendar_month_number" AS "month",
       SUM(s."amount_sold")      AS "total_amount"
FROM   "sales"      AS s
JOIN   "times"      AS t ON t."time_id" = s."time_id"
WHERE  s."cust_id"  IN (
          SELECT "cust_id" FROM "customers"
          WHERE "country_id" = (
                SELECT "country_id" FROM "countries"
                WHERE "country_name" = 'France'
          )
)
AND    s."channel_id" IN (
          SELECT "channel_id" FROM "channels"
          WHERE "channel_total_id" = 1
)
AND    s."promo_id"  IN (
          SELECT "promo_id" FROM "promotions"
          WHERE "promo_total_id" = 1
)
AND    t."calendar_year" = 2019
GROUP BY t."calendar_month_number"
ORDER BY t."calendar_month_number"
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
--Description: Aggregate monthly sales amounts in 2020 (for growth‑rate comparison)
SELECT t."calendar_month_number" AS "month",
       SUM(s."amount_sold")      AS "total_amount"
FROM   "sales" AS s
JOIN   "times" AS t ON t."time_id" = s."time_id"
WHERE  s."cust_id" IN (
          SELECT "cust_id" FROM "customers"
          WHERE "country_id" = (
                SELECT "country_id" FROM "countries"
                WHERE "country_name" = 'France'
          )
)
AND    s."channel_id" IN (
          SELECT "channel_id" FROM "channels"
          WHERE "channel_total_id" = 1
)
AND    s."promo_id"  IN (
          SELECT "promo_id" FROM "promotions"
          WHERE "promo_total_id" = 1
)
AND    t."calendar_year" = 2020
GROUP BY t."calendar_month_number"
ORDER BY t."calendar_month_number"
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
--Description: Pull France’s currency conversion factors to USD (needed for 2019‑2021)
SELECT DISTINCT "year",
       "month",
       "to_us"
FROM   "currency"
WHERE  "country" = 'France'
AND    "year"   IN (2019, 2020, 2021)
LIMIT 20;
```

These queries should give you enough visibility into the key values and data ranges needed before you write the final projection / growth‑rate / median calculation SQL.
